B.anF=new A.d8("Same-day pediatric sick visit","High priority",0,"Pediatrician urgent visit or urgent care","Recent fever-type or respiratory-type signals mean the baby may need a same-day clinical review rather than waiting for the next routine well visit.","Review temperature pattern, breathing effort, congestion, cough, feeding tolerance, and hydration. Escalate urgently if breathing looks hard, baby is very sleepy, or fever is significant for age.","Bring temperature readings, fever duration, breathing changes, feeding changes, wet diapers, and any color-change or lethargy concerns.","baby_same_day_sick_visit",B.bPM,96)
