B.cHE=new A.ab("Why do some screens show different content postpartum?","Contessa adapts by care stage. Pregnancy and postpartum journeys have different symptoms, risks, and care goals, so the app changes the guidance and tracking it prioritizes.")
B.cGU=new A.ab("Does Contessa replace my doctor or midwife?","No. Contessa is a support tool. It helps you track, summarize, and advocate, but it does not replace clinical care.")
